- op: discuss  # a785
  at: '2026-10-04T01:27:28Z'  # a785
  by: agent  # a785
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a785
  clock: 6  # a785
  nonce: a785  # a785
  message: "Merged in PR #1438 (dev 81caa3999d). Integrated together: WI-kutal + WI-ratid (which restores the 2098 django edges kutal alone would have lost) + INV-dulum/WI-safit.\n\nFixed in PR #1438 (commit 431c198905 on jgstern-agent/fix/dulum). The file-scoped imports/module_imports are now narrowed per call site by ScopeStack.value_shadowed(): the names whose nearest LEGB binding is a VALUE (param/assignment/def/except-as), with an import or global in a nearer frame settling the name as live. Behavioural evidence, re-run of the filed repro:\n- `import socket; def f(socket, h): s = socket.socket(h); s.send(b\"x\")` now emits python:external:0-0:socket and python:external:0-0:send (before: python:socket:0-0:socket and python:socket.socket:0-0:send).\n- The depth-2 form `def f(http, h): http.client.HTTPConnection(h)` is untyped.\n- io-boundaries on a param/module/from-import shadow fixture: 6 boundary calls before, 3 after (only the unshadowed control remains).\n- The strict xfail test_a_local_shadow_should_not_be_typed is now a passing test. test_a_function_local_import_is_still_typed pins the trap (a lazy import IS the module).\n\nCorpus: 231 such scopes in 45,702 files (70 production). Catalogued io-boundaries unchanged on fastapi, django and airflow, so the effect there is on edges only (-19/+8 django, -109/+80 airflow).\n\nGENERAL STATEMENT NOT ASSERTED: the map is still BUILT file-scoped, so a function-local `import mysock as socket` in one function retypes `socket` everywhere. That is WI-kizih-folor-fuvin-hazul-gibad-komij-muvob-nijid, along with the consumers the narrowing does not reach. Siblings: WI-dagig (JS/TS), WI-lijab (Java), WI-kugap (Go)."  # a785
